---
layout: base.njk
title: "RAS Calculator: Estimate Your Relative Athletic Score"
description: "Free RAS calculator. Enter your combine numbers and position to estimate your Relative Athletic Score from 0 to 10, with grades for size, speed, explosion, agility and strength."
canonicalPath: "/ras-calculator"
pageStyle: |-
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
    :root {
      --bg: #080c10;
      --surface: #0f1419;
      --surface2: #161c24;
      --border: #1e2832;
      --accent: #aaff00;
      --accent-dim: rgba(170,255,0,0.12);
      --accent-glow: rgba(170,255,0,0.35);
      --text: #e8edf2;
      --text-muted: #5a6470;
      --text-mid: #8a96a4;
      --red: #ff4d4d;
      --orange: #ff9000;
      --yellow: #ffd600;
      --green: #aaff00;
      --blue: #00cfff;
      --font-display: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }
  
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
  
    header {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text);
    }
  
    h1 span { color: var(--accent); display: block; }
  
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
  
    .container {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }
  
    .site-link {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .site-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .site-link strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    .links-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 500px) { .links-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .card-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .format-tabs {
      display: flex;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 4px;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .format-tab {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 9px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
  
    .format-tab.active { background: var(--accent); color: #000; font-weight: 700; }
  
    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 520px) { .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
  
    .field select,
    .field input {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      appearance: none;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .field select:focus,
    .field input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-dim);
    }
  
    .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  
    .calc-btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
    }
  
    .calc-btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
    .calc-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
  
    #results { display: none; }
    #results.visible { display: block; }
  
    .gauge-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .gauge-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 320px; height: 320px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-dim) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  
    /* Speed conversions strip */
    .conversions-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .conv-item { text-align: center; }
  
    .conv-val {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--accent);
      transition: color 0.5s;
    }
  
    .conv-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
  
    .gauge-svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      overflow: visible;
    }
  
    .gauge-track {
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--surface2);
      stroke-width: 18;
      stroke-linecap: round;
    }
  
    .gauge-fill {
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 18;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), stroke 0.6s ease;
    }
  
    .verdict {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
  
    .verdict-sub { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); }
  
    .compare-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .compare-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    .compare-icon {
      width: 42px; height: 42px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  
    .compare-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .compare-title { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .compare-val { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
    .compare-avg { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  
    .badge {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  
    .badge-above { background: rgba(170,255,0,0.15); color: var(--accent); }
    .badge-at    { background: rgba(255,214,0,0.15); color: var(--yellow); }
    .badge-below { background: rgba(255,77,77,0.12); color: var(--red); }
  
    .bar-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .bar-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .bar-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
  
    .bar-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 115px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .bar-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border-radius: 100px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
  
    .bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 100px;
      transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .bar-you-marker {
      position: absolute;
      top: -3px;
      width: 14px; height: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-glow);
      transition: left 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .bar-val { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 58px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .scale-strip {
      display: flex;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  
    .scale-strip div { flex: 1; }
  
    .scale-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .info-card {
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border: 1px solid rgba(170,255,0,0.2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .info-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
    .info-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.6; }
    .info-text strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  
    footer a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  
    .anim { animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both; }
    .anim-d1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .anim-d2 { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .anim-d3 { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    .anim-d4 { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
  
    .you-row .bar-fill { background: var(--accent); }
    .you-row .bar-label { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  
    /* ── ARTICLE SECTION ── */
    .article-section {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .article-section h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .article-section h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none; }
  
    .article-section h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0.6rem;
    }
  
    .article-section p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  
    .article-section p strong { color: var(--text); }
    .article-section a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .article-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  
    .data-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 1.75rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .data-table thead { background: var(--surface2); }
  
    .data-table th {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .data-table td {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-mid);
      background: var(--surface);
    }
  
    .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .data-table td:first-child { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
    .data-table .highlight td { background: rgba(170,255,0,0.07); }
    .data-table .highlight td:first-child { color: var(--accent); }
  
    /* ── FAQ ── */
    .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.25rem 0; }
    .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  
    .faq-q {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
  
    .faq-a { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.7; }
    .faq-a a { color: var(--accent); }
    .format-tab { cursor: pointer; }
    .ht-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .form-note { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 1rem 0 0; }
    .form-error { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--red); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; min-height: 1em; }
    .bar-sub { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    #cat-wrap .bar-label, #bars-wrap .bar-label { line-height: 1.25; }
  </style>
disclaimer:
  - "Estimated score only. Relative Athletic Score (RAS) was created by Kent Lee Platte; official scores use his full historical database."
  - "Position norms are approximate NFL combine averages. Not affiliated with the NFL or any athletic organization."
jsonld: |-
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebApplication",
    "name": "RAS Calculator",
    "description": "Free calculator that estimates a Relative Athletic Score (RAS) on the 0–10 scale from NFL combine measurements, with category grades for size, speed, explosion, agility and strength.",
    "url": "https://athletecalculator.com/ras-calculator",
    "applicationCategory": "HealthApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Web",
    "offers": {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "price": "0",
      "priceCurrency": "USD"
    },
    "creator": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Athlete Calculator"
    }
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is a good RAS score?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A RAS of 8.0 or higher is considered elite, and 9.0 or higher is exceptional. Most NFL draft prospects score between 4.0 and 7.0. A score around 5.0 is about average for a prospect at that position."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How is Relative Athletic Score calculated?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Each combine measurement is converted to a 0 to 10 score based on where it ranks among players at the same position, then the scores are combined into one composite. Size, speed, explosion, agility and strength tests all count, and missing tests are left out rather than scored as zero."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How many tests do you need for a RAS?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "RAS needs at least six measurements to produce a composite score, and height and weight each count as one. More tests give a more reliable score. This calculator follows the same six-measurement minimum."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is this the official RAS?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. RAS was created by Kent Lee Platte, and official scores are based on his full historical database of combine and pro day results. This calculator estimates a RAS-style score from approximate position averages, so it can differ from an official score by a point or more."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Does RAS predict NFL success?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Only partly. Higher RAS players are drafted earlier and get more chances, and at speed-dependent positions like cornerback and edge rusher a high score is a useful signal. But many great players tested poorly, including Tom Brady and Jerry Rice, so RAS works best alongside film and production."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://athletecalculator.com"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "RAS Calculator",
        "item": "https://athletecalculator.com/ras-calculator"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
---
<header>
<p class="eyebrow">Free NFL Draft Tool</p>
<h1>RAS<span>Calculator</span></h1>
<p class="subtitle">Enter your combine numbers and position to estimate your Relative Athletic Score on the 0–10 scale, with a grade for size, speed, explosion, agility and strength.</p>
</header><div class="container">
<div class="links-row">
<a class="site-link" href="/relative-athletic-score-nfl">
      ↑ <strong>What Is RAS?</strong> Full Explainer by Position
    </a>
<a class="site-link" href="/40-yard-dash-calculator">
      ↑ <strong>40-Yard Dash</strong> Calculator by Position
    </a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="card-label">Your Combine Numbers</p>
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field full">
<label for="pos">Position</label>
<select id="pos">
<option value="WR">Wide Receiver</option>
<option value="CB">Cornerback</option>
<option value="RB">Running Back</option>
<option value="S">Safety</option>
<option value="LB">Linebacker</option>
<option value="QB">Quarterback</option>
<option value="TE">Tight End</option>
<option value="DE">Defensive End / Edge</option>
<option value="DT">Defensive Tackle</option>
<option value="OL">Offensive Tackle / Guard</option>
<option value="C">Center</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="htft">Height</label>
<div class="ht-row">
<input id="htft" max="7" min="5" placeholder="ft" step="1" type="number" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Height feet"/>
<input id="htin" max="11.875" min="0" placeholder="in" step="0.125" type="number" inputmode="decimal" aria-label="Height inches"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="wt">Weight (lbs)</label>
<input id="wt" max="400" min="140" placeholder="e.g. 205" step="1" type="number" inputmode="numeric"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="t40">40-Yard Dash (s)</label>
<input id="t40" max="6.5" min="4.1" placeholder="e.g. 4.52" step="0.01" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="t10">10-Yard Split (s)</label>
<input id="t10" max="2.3" min="1.35" placeholder="optional" step="0.01" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="vert">Vertical Jump (in)</label>
<input id="vert" max="48" min="15" placeholder="e.g. 35.5" step="0.5" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="broad">Broad Jump (in)</label>
<input id="broad" max="150" min="70" placeholder="e.g. 122" step="1" type="number" inputmode="numeric"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="cone">3-Cone Drill (s)</label>
<input id="cone" max="9.5" min="6.2" placeholder="optional" step="0.01" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="shuttle">20-Yard Shuttle (s)</label>
<input id="shuttle" max="6" min="3.7" placeholder="optional" step="0.01" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field full">
<label for="bench">225 lb Bench Reps</label>
